window.products.push({"id":601120,"name":"Scanpan Classic Mixed Grill, 17-1/4-Inch by 11-3/4-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31KADR8aQIL._AC_.jpg","description":"Famous Danish design, traditional, solid craftsmanship and the latest advances in technology combine to set Scanpan Classic Cookware apart. Scanpan Classic is made of solid squeeze-cast aluminum, forged into shape with 200 tons of pressure. The optimum thickness of the pan base prevents warping and keeps the pan base perfectly flat, especially important when used with glass top or ceramic ranges. The pan thickness and unique ceramic-titanium surface allows for browning, searing and deglazing. The patented nonstick surface is created by firing ceramic-titanium particles into the pan and a specially formulated nonstick compound is embedded in the ceramic-titanium surface. Scanpan Green Tek non-stick surface is PFOA-free in all stages of the manufacturing process. Scanpan Classic Cookware can be used with high heat frying and is oven safe to 500-degrees. Scanpan Classic is safe to use with metal utensils.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31KADR8aQIL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Scanpan","source_asin":"B005PPYVTG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-601120","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005PPYVTG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005PPYVTG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":601121,"name":"InfuseZen Turkish Towel - Thin & Absorbent Peshtemal Beach Bath Towels - 100% Cotton Oversized Hammam Fouta Towel Lightweight Pool, Gym, Travel Towel ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91py662b5YS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Thinner Than A Bed Sheet. Lighter Than A Regular Towel. Yet SO MUCH MORE ABSORBENT? Is That Possible? If you are sick and tired of all those bulky beach and bath towels that lose their softness and absorbency after every wash, then this is your lucky day. Introducing The InfuseZen Premium 100% Turkish Cotton Towel With Vibrant Colors and Fun Flamingo design Now you can finally have a gym towel that is not only ultra-lightweight and thin, but also extremely absorbent! And The Best Part? Your peshtemal towel will get EVEN MORE ABSORBENT after every wash! Top 3 Reasons To Choose Our Hammam Towel: 100% Turkish Cotton Fabric: unlike other cheaply-made bath towels, our fouta towel is made from 100% premium Turkish cotton, which has longer fibers and will become softer and fluffier after every wash. Please know, that small cotton balls may appear after your first few washes. This is not lint! These will come off easily and will happen as the cotton softens and becomes more absorbent. One Towel, Unlimited Uses: you can use your Turkish towel as a gym towel, bath towel, pool towel, camping towel, hammam towel, fouta towel, picnic blanket or beach blanket. Oversized Yet Super-Packable: our thin Turkish cotton towel is ideal for your business trips, summer vacations, trips to the beach or your family weekend away, since its ultralightweight and packable. Need More Reasons? Available In 2 Beautiful Color Combinations (Coral/White and Pink/White) Stylish Boho Striped Design Great Housewarming Gift For Your Loved Ones What Are You Waiting For? Indulge Yourself! Click \"Add To Cart\" NOW & Spoil Yourself With A InfuseZen Turkish Towel!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91py662b5YS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"InfuseZen","source_asin":"B08SLCZ2DH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-601121","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SLCZ2DH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SLCZ2DH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
