window.products.push({"id":601172,"name":"PACHIRA E-Commerce US 9 Cube Storage Organizer Wood Display Shelf, Free Standing Cubby Bookcase Cabinet Divider Bookshelf for Home, Office, Kitchen, W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":74.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qIu+mOgDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【9 CUBE ORGANIZER】: The 9 cube is stable, provide large storage space helps you personalize your decor with your favorite boxes or bins. Various color can be chosen, greatly meet your different needs. Makes better use of space to orderly store, organize and display your items. 【PREMIUM QUALITY ORGANIZATION】: Made of high quality particleboard for easy cleaning and long service life. Each cube can hold up to 11 pounds. The table top can hold up to 50 pounds with no problem. Cube construction offers superb stability and durability for long-term use. 【VERSATILE STORAGE CUBE】: Open-back and closed-back cubes help personalize your decor with photos, plants, crafts, collections, CDs, toys, small appliances, etc. - giving you more style than all-closed-back cabinets. The color is elegant and refreshing. Great for bedroom, kitchen, study room, living room, entryway, office, nursery, etc. 【DIMENSION】: 35.63\"Lx11.61\"Wx35.63\"H, It accommodates any storage bin that is 11\" W x 11\" D x 11\" H. 【EASY TO ASSEMBLE】: Easy-to-follow instructions and hardware kit included, and we also provide installation video on the page. If you find missing hardware kit when you receive the products, please contact us as soon as possible, and we will resend them to you immediately for free.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qIu+mOgDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PACHIRA E-Commerce","source_asin":"B0BNN5W3W7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-601172","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNN5W3W7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNN5W3W7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":601173,"name":"Boston International C781000 IHR Paper Cocktail Napkins (20 Count), Cabin Life, 5 x 5\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.2,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jt1HnLepL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Create dynamic tablescapes and stunning place settings by pairing Ideal Home Range's patterned napkins with matching plates and coordinating solids. Plates and napkins are offered in multiple sizes, allowing you to mix and match, layer and customize. For weddings and cocktail parties to summer BBQs and everyday use, choose from a variety of designs just right for your next event or get together. Ideal Home Range offers a sustainable option for conscientious consumers; napkin tissue is 100% cellulose from cracked wood (fallen trees) and plantation wood (managed forests where trees are planted specifically for the production of paper materials) and all tissue is oxygen bleached without the use of chlorine. IHR ink is water soluble, contains no heavy metals or solvents of any kind and meets the requirements of German Food and Health laws and the USFDA. Used ink is never dumped into sewage and is always recycled and reintegrated into the color system. The production working area is naturally pollution-free and no harmful emissions are produced. IHR has earned a certificate of approval from the Forest Stewardship Council (FSC), a prestigious certificate only awarded to those who meet all of the FSC's standards for sustainability, forest management, well being of the forest workers and effects on indigenous peoples and the local environment. Ideal Home Range is exclusively represented in the United States by Boston International and is considered to be the international market leader and trendsetter in the field of high-class table decoration and interior accessories.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jt1HnLepL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Boston International","source_asin":"B07D2DPR99","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-601173","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D2DPR99","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D2DPR99","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
