window.products.push({"id":601177,"name":"Inspire Q Maxwell Wood and Tufted Linen Bed by Classic Beige Upholstered Queen Transitional, Americana, Traditional","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71INsDmejpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Give your bedroom an elegant look with the Maxwell wood and tufted linen bed by iNSPIRE Q Classic. This bed's headboard features a dark cherry finish wood frame and a coordinating tufted linen panel. This classic look is completed with a dark cherry frame and footboard. This piece is ideal for any space with its stylish and timeless design. Available in beige, grey, and dark grey linen upholstery.Full and queen sets include: One (1) Headboard, One (1) Footboard, One (1) Set of Rails, Three (3) SlatsKing set includes: One (1) Headboard, One (1) Footboard, One (1) Set of Rails, five (5) SlatsUpholstery: Beige, grey, and dark grey linenBeautiful dark cherry wood finishMaterials: Rubberwood, linen fabric, foam, MDFDimensions:Footboard height: 15 inchesFull internal mattress opening: 77 inches long x 55 inches wideFull overall dimensions: 79.3 inches long x 58 inches wide x 53 inches highQueen internal mattress opening: 82 inches long x 61 inches wideQueen overall dimensions: 84.3 inches long x 64 inches wide x 53 inches highKing internal mattress opening: 82 inches long x 77 inches wideKing overall dimensions: 84.3 inches long x 80 inches wide x 53 inches highAssembly required. This product ships in Three (3) boxes.Mattress, box spring, and bedding (comforter, sheets, pillows, etc.) are not included. Exquisite and inviting, iQ Classic encompasses traditional and transitional designs. Taking cues from time-honored craftsmanship, these pieces simultaneously draw from tried and true roots and contemporary elements. With a breadth of styles to choose from, transform your home into a welcoming haven with iQ Classic.At iNSPIRE Q, our designer-curated lifestyles reflect current trends and timeless essentials, giving you the know-how to achieve your vision. With diverse style inspirations to choose from, you'll be able to find the one that speaks to you - or mix and match across collections for a style that's all your own.Whether you're cool and contemporary, retro, free-spirit","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71INsDmejpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Inspire Q","source_asin":"B07KNDC7C9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-601177","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KNDC7C9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KNDC7C9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
