window.products.push({"id":601362,"name":"Slash Digital Kitchen Timer Cooking Timer Clock with Loud Alarm Magnetic Back and Retractable Stand Minute Second Countdown Clear LCD Display (Pink) S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BKugajqzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Slash cooking timer digital is designed with portable and compact body, lightweight to take it anywhere.It has three ways for you to place. Magnet on back, allow you to put the timer on metallic surface, such as refrigerator; The stand on back, allow you to put the timer on the table; The stand also can be used as clip, with which you can clip the timer on your apron or clothing. You may ask, why there is no turn on/off switch for this timer? that's because the timer should stand by for you all the time, ready to serve you immediately anytime and anywhere. But you will not worry about batteries waste, as it is energy saving, even the timer stand by all the time, one battery can last for a long time. Slash kitchen timer is made of high quality ABS material with clear and large LCD display, which allow you to see the time easily. The alarm is easy to hear in another room but not too loud to be deafening. The timer will remember the last setting, which is useful for repetitive activities. Function 1. Buzzing output when it counts down at last second 2. It has timer memory recall function. Timing Setting 1. Press MIN button to advance minute digits (deep sound can be heard). Press the MIN button for more than 1 Second for speed setting. 2. Press SEC button to advance second digits (deep sound can be heard). Press the SEC button for more than 1 second for speed. setting 3. Press MIN and SEC button at the same time to reset timer to zero. Specifications Time unit: Min and Sec Power: 1 x AAA battery (not included) Size: 2.8 x 2.5 x 0.8 inches Weight: 1.8 ounces Package: box Package contents: Kitchen timerUser manual Tips 1. Operate it under the conduction of its user manual. 2. When the display is becoming dim or alarm is starting not clear enough, please change the battery.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BKugajqzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Slash","source_asin":"B01LWPTEYV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-601362","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LWPTEYV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LWPTEYV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
