window.products.push({"id":601561,"name":"Personalized Custom Wine Labels- Set of 30 Removable and Reusable Wine Labels for Home Winemakers and Brewers- Country Life 3.3x4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ymYqmAnOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Click the \"Customize Now\" button to personalize the text to make this label design all your own. And don't worry if things aren't perfect, our designers will make sure everything looks great before printing. The printed design will emulate the product photos, correcting any text justification or size discrepancies (see note in product description below). Comes as a set of 30 peel & stick removable, reusable, permanent, washable, and erasable labels Vibrant digital printing on \"The Everything Label\" material lets you manage your wine and beer labeling any way you want. The advanced adhesive makes it both a removable and a permanent label. It stays on while soaking in an ice bucket and when cellared on your wine rack, but peels right off when you’re ready to remove it or reuse it. No washing or scrubbing required. Plus it’s a reusable label, so you can put it on another bottle or reposition if you don’t get it right the first time. And it’s also completely washable. Leave the label on the bottle, wash and sanitize as usual, and reuse the labeled bottle as is. It also has an erasable surface. Just use a permanent marker to write on the label, then erase with rubbing alcohol for your next batch. SIZE: 3.3 inches wide by 4 inches tall, can be used on most Burgundy and Bordeaux style bottles, as well as many beer bottles Watercolor country scene personalized wine label style for all your homemade wine beer mead and beverages, and perfect custom wine label for wedding and gifts","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ymYqmAnOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Noontime Labels","source_asin":"B0B787XRHT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-601561","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B787XRHT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B787XRHT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
