window.products.push({"id":601590,"name":"2 Short Original Banksia Tea Light Candle Holder Hand Turned Made from The Australian Banksia Seed Pod, Unique by Nature, One of Kind, No Two The Same","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91zwgi+Ao3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These Beautiful Hand Crafted Tea Light Candle Holders are made from a particular type of Banksia called ‘Grandis' also commonly known as Bull Banksia or Giant Banksia. The Bull Banksia tree is found in the harsh Western Australia out Back and this variety can grow up to 15 metres tall and produce large cylindrical yellow flowers that can reach up to 35cm long. It takes 24 months from the time the tree produces the flower to the time the Banksia nut reaches maturity and is suitable for picking. The tree re-grows its pods over and over again makes the Banksia an incredibly renewable resource. The collection of the seed pods is highly regulated by the Department of Parks and Wildlife Western Australia. The seed pods collected have expelled their seeds and have completed the lifecycle of the plant. They are handpicked to ensure no damage is done to the tree itself or the Australian bushland. The collectors go in to the bush on foot, careful not to disturb any surrounding plants or wildlife and no heavy machinery is used during this process. A royalty is paid to the Western Australian Forestry per seed pod, which goes to aid in forest management and conservation. Each candle Holder is crafted by hand using a woodturning lathe, they are then hollowed out and a chisel is then used to shave away the outside of the seed pod revealing its natural pattern. Once the Tea Light Candle Holder is carved the Banksia Seed Pods, reveals its unique texture and personality. These beautiful Candle Holders with the candlelight flickering through naturally formed holes instantly adds ambiance to any room. Included in the box: 2 Tea Light Holders, 2 Tea Light Candles and an information booklet Candle Holder Measures Approximately 2in W x 3in H.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91zwgi+Ao3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BANKSIA GIFTS AUSTRALIA B","source_asin":"B07YYX175P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-601590","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YYX175P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YYX175P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
