window.products.push({"id":601603,"name":"Central Air Conditioner Covers for Outside Units, Waterproof Windproof Heavy Duty Large AC Covers Square for Winter Outdoor Protection (24x24x30inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51H1DDPH6ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Universal Size] Outdoor AC covers is designed to fits up to 24×24×30 inches(L x W x H), suit for most of standard central air conditioner. Please measure your AC units first to determine the correct cover size before purchasing it. [Heavy Duty & Water Proof Air Conditioner Cover] High-quality 600D polyester oxford, (more durable than 420D material), which is tear-resistant and with stronger waterproof performance, to protect the outdoor ac unit from extreme weather damage, such as rain and snow. The interior is coated with silver to better prevent UV rays from eroding the machine and the cover itself, preventing ageing caused by UV rays, and it will not shrink with prolonged use and can be used all year round. [Velcro Design Easy to Install ] Consider the outer air conditioning duct, we have designed Velcro openings on the sides to provide a good seal while leaving an exit for the outer air conditioning duct, without leaving the cover uneven. Installation is also easy, simply attach the Velcro and can complete the installation. Two padded handles can easily move and install. [Air Vent & Bottom Drawstring for Windproof] The special design of the air vent allows the inside of the cover to keep ventilated and dry to prevent the machine from getting moldy or rusty, and at the same time allows the insider air to be discharged better without making the cover expand unevenly due to the wind blowing. The adjustable drawstring at the bottom allows the cover to fit the machine better without swinging due to the wind. [Easy to Clean and Store] This air conditioning cover can be rinsed with water or wiped with towels for daily maintenance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51H1DDPH6ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DTRK","source_asin":"B0BBKW2D42","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-601603","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBKW2D42","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBKW2D42","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
