window.products.push({"id":601613,"name":"Set of 6 Gray Coasters for Drinks , Silicone Coasters with Grooved Design, Durable Coasters for Table Top Protection, Anti Slip, Non- Stick, Housewarm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710j7o7fDAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Protect Your Tables - The coasters have a diameter of 4 inches and are perfect to use under your mug, teacup, glasses to help prevent scratches or rings from liquids. Choose our thick, durable and long-lasting coasters that will not be damaged even after repeated use. Grooved Design - The grooves on the silicone coasters' surface can store water droplets in the water cup. Works the same as the coasters for drinks absorbent, no water droplets on the table. Keeping the table clean and dry. The bottom of coasters for drinks is a concave and convex circle design, which is more slip-resistant. Will not move or slide when placed on the table. Soft Silicone - Cup coasters are made of high quality silicone, soft, durable and not easy to deform. You can use it for a long time without fading. Unlike cork coasters, our silicone coasters are not easy to get dirt trace. Grooved design avoids full contact with the cup and won't stick to the silicone coasters for drinks when you pick up a cold or hot beverage cup. Perfect Addition to Your Table - These colorful coasters are an eye catching and beautiful way to protect your favorite tables when using your drink ware and mugs. These coasters make a great decoration and add a nice pop of color to your home. Easy to Clean - Silicone drink coasters are easier to clean than marble coasters or wood coasters. You can rinse the coasters with water or put it in the dishwasher since they are dishwasher safe. Perfectly saves your time and energy of cleaning, free your hands!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710j7o7fDAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hoomey","source_asin":"B0BK875C2G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-601613","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BK875C2G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BK875C2G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
