window.products.push({"id":601759,"name":"Kavion Whipped-Cream Dispenser - Highly Durable Professional Cream Whipper - 6 Decorating Tips - Leak Free Seals - 8g N2O Charger Not Included - Silic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zUstyBLCS._AC_SL1243_.jpg","description":"COMMERCIAL GRADE DISPENSER – Are you looking to buy a whipped cream dispenser that will serve you excellently whether you use it at home or a cafeteria? Then look no farther than our Kavion Aluminum Whipped Cream Dispensers. This commercial-grade dispenser will serve your needs perfectly and make it possible for you to enjoy some coffee or dessert within minutes. ALUMINUM MATERIAL – We focus on manufacturing high quality whipped cream dispensers that will serve you for an extended time. Moreover, we ensure that the quality of the material does not distort the taste of the whipped cream or pose a risk to your health. It is for this reason that we use premium, durable Aluminum. SILICONE ERGONOMIC HANDLE – The ease of use is a factor that we give the ultimate priority when we manufacture this whipped cream dispenser. It is for this reason that we design a silicone ergonomic handle that allows you to lift the dispenser with ease as you make your whipped cream. 6 DECORATIVE TIPS – Are you the type that loves to design his or her whipped cream into certain shapes? Then we have got you with our Kavion Aluminum Whipped Cream Dispenser, which comes with up to six decorative tips. We include three stainless steel decorating tips and three plastic ones. Moreover, you will also get a cleaning brush in the package as well. N2O CHARGE COMPATIBLE – We ensure that you will not have to worry about how you will power your whipped cream dispenser once you have it in your home. We make it compatible with any N20 charger to give you the convenience of powering up the dispenser simply. However, the dispenser is not compatible with CO2 cartridges.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zUstyBLCS._AC_SL1243_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kavion","source_asin":"B08Y7WLVQ3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-601759","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Y7WLVQ3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Y7WLVQ3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
