window.products.push({"id":601856,"name":"Whimsical Christmas Tree Copper Cookie Cutter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bz-UWnG8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking for a treat for a special holiday party? Why not bake up a batch of Christmas Tree cookies! Don't feel like baking ~ these make great gifts too. Who wouldn't love a whimsical tree silhouette cookie cutter from a friend! Each cookie cutter is hand crafted in our workshop from heavy weight solid copper. This cookie cutter is built to last for many generations of cookie baking, fondant cutting, ornament making, or even use it for tracing quilt patterns. We're a small family business with a passion for creating cookie cutters. We sign each of our cookie cutters with a little makers mark ~ nothing fancy just a hand engraved mark from one of our four cookie cutter makers. Made from very heavy weight copper to maintain shape while using and storing. Great for gift giving or as a centerpiece to a cookie bouquet! Each one is slightly different from the next as they are formed one at a time and hand soldered using lead-free silver solder. Listing is for one cookie cutter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bz-UWnG8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Fussy Pup","source_asin":"B07DHQS8S5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-601856","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DHQS8S5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DHQS8S5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
