window.products.push({"id":601954,"name":"Large Modern Nature Canvas Art for Living Room, Bedroom, Bathroom, Dining & Home Office – Wood-Framed Landscape Wall Decor With a Photo Shot by an Int","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":56.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EW5qkJaNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This landscape canvas wall art is the perfect way to bring a touch of nature into any space in and around your home or office. Each piece is printed with solvent-free HP latex inks, ensuring that they are safe for all families to enjoy. Not only that, but our art is also hand-stretched over a natural wood frame, adding an extra level of quality and craftsmanship to each piece. Our high-resolution photo printing process captures every detail of the stunning landscape, making each piece come alive with vibrant colors and stunning imagery. Plus, the UV-resistant inks used in our printing process guarantee that your art will not fade over time, so you can enjoy your piece for years to come. But what really sets our wall artwork apart is the fact that the photo was taken by an international award-winning photographer. This means that you are not just buying a piece of art, but a piece of art created by a master of the craft. Each piece is a true work of art that will be admired by all who see it. Also, we have multiple decorative frame designs available, making it easy for you to find the perfect fit for your home decor. Our art is perfect for any room in your home, whether it's the living room, bedroom, or even the office. And, with a variety of sizes available (12x16, 16x24, 24x36, and 40x60), we’re sure to have something for everyone. With our hanging wall art, you’re making sure that you have a piece of art that is truly one of a kind. So, add one of our USA-made canvas wall art pieces to your home today and enjoy the beauty of nature all year round!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EW5qkJaNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0BTQPSFQY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-601954","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTQPSFQY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTQPSFQY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
