window.products.push({"id":601977,"name":"Chic Home Utopia 4 Piece Reversible Duvet Cover Set Patchwork Bohemian Paisley Print Design Bedding-Decorative Pillow Shams Included, Queen, Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":52.52,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91uneNU-TbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A contemporary duvet cover set with everything you need to give your bedroom a bold, fresh look. The duvet cover features patchwork Bohemian paisley print on the face with a minimalist solid color design on the reverse. Design coordinated super-soft microfiber sheets, pillowcases, reversible pillow shams and a Boho-inspired embroidered decorative pillow are included to complete the look. Specifications: Size: Queen Color Scheme: Navy, Blue, White Piece Count: 4 Set Includes: 1pc Reversible Duvet Cover (90” x 90”) 2pc Reversible Pillow Shams (20” x 26” + 2”) 1pc Embroidered Boho-Inspired Decorative Pillow (12” x 18”) Materials: Luxuriously brushed microfiber fabric Fabric and Design: Soft brushed microfiber cotton-feel material Fashion forward patchwork Bohemian paisley print design on the face with a minimalist solid color backing Features: Hidden zipper closure design for easy care Luxuriously soft feel for a great night sleep with less tossing and turning Fits everything from light blankets to heavy duvets Built to last with premium fabrics and expert stitching Care Instructions Dry clean preferred. Machine washable, use front loader machine (or top loader without agitator) to avoid tearing, use cold water on gentle cycle, tumble dry low * Add 2 tennis balls to the dryer to speed up drying and add fluffiness The digital images we display have the most accurate color possible. However, due to differences in computer monitors, we cannot be responsible for variations in color between the actual product and your screen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91uneNU-TbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chic Home","source_asin":"B07N283ZF7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-601977","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07N283ZF7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07N283ZF7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":601978,"name":"Lifeline 7502 Silver Stainless Steel Wide Mouth Water Bottle - 40 oz. Capacity","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31ICU0Lm39L._AC_.jpg","description":"40 ounce wide mouth, vacuum insulated water bottles are of perfect size for a daily use bottle, and sized perfectly for easy grip. Its 40 ounce capacity is the ideal size to fill with your favorite beverage of choice, hot or cold. The double-wall, vacuum insulated bottle is specifically designed to keep liquids hot or cold all day. Double-wall technology also prevents condensation and keeps the outside wall of the bottle at a comfortable temperature, regardless of whether it is carrying a hot or cold beverage. The bottles are constructed from high quality, food grade 18/8 stainless steel, which unlike aluminum bottles, does not require any kind of liner. The stainless steel bottles will not retain odor or taste, and are 100 percent recyclable. All components of the bottle, including the lid, are 100 percent BPA free.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31ICU0Lm39L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lifeline","source_asin":"B00BJHS6X6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-601978","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BJHS6X6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BJHS6X6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
